*Originally posted on Facebook, July 9, 2024*

Let us at this time draw near to Benjamin in heart and in truth in order to support Ben as he suffers coming to terms with the absence of Shannon; the help-mate that was a gift of Love. Let us encourage him that the darkest moments of life; when we walk through the valley of the shadow of death - these are as veils of the greatest potential.  "That which we look upon as disaster - is the door to highest opportunity." {EGW}

